{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every suitcase in the scene, it is positioned on the left side of the image and serves as the base for a vertical arrangement of items. Directly above the suitcase is a mouse, and the suitcase is larger than the mouse. Above the mouse is a watch, above the watch is a cup, and a knife is located above the cup, with the knife being positioned on the top side of the image.",
